summary: various-simple-checks
description: Verify that rsyslog passes various basic sanity checks including correct PID file creation, absence of segfaults on restart, proper config validation return codes, and correct handling of the net.aclResolveHostname global option.
contact: Dalibor Pospíšil <dapospis@redhat.com>
test: ./runtest.sh
require+:
  - library(distribution/RpmSnapshot)
recommend:
  - rsyslog
duration: 10m
enabled: true
tag:
  - CI-Tier-1
  - NoRHEL4
  - NoRHEL5
  - TIPpass_Security
  - TierCandidatesFAIL
extra-summary: /CoreOS/rsyslog/Sanity/various-simple-checks
extra-task: /CoreOS/rsyslog/Sanity/various-simple-checks
extra-nitrate: TC#0551877
adjust:
  - enabled: false
    when: distro == rhel-4, rhel-5
    continue: false
id: 4f7dc676-ec12-4b39-927d-8256e249eec3
